:6:1521823005:1":{"text":"My Lord, while clearing the battlefield, we found <style=\"highlight\">Lieutenant Lygos' shortsword</style>, but we don't know who to give it to.","source_cn":"领主殿下，我们清理战场的时候找到了<style=hig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53CC9E5270880A5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521823006:1":{"text":"I've inquired, and all of the lieutenant's relatives have passed away. The person closest to him was General Perseus.","source_cn":"我打听过了，副将大人的亲人都已去世。军队里和他关系最好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6094E5AAAFB2813","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521823007:1":{"text":"But the general has also passed...","source_cn":"可是，统帅大人也……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA94D41FC2ACA733","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1521823007":{"text":"But the general has also passed...","source_cn":"可是，统帅大人也……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA94D41FC2ACA733","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521823008:1":{"text":"The general and the lieutenant used to train together all the time. Those two were almost like brothers.","source_cn":"统帅和副将以前经常一起训练、互相照顾，就跟亲兄弟一样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D84959E1BA65F70","variant_status":"","male":"","female"